ussie moet stellen zonder daar een eenvoudig antwoord op te vinden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL872773W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p078216117","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p085356573","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p371614406","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p830736387","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p841089167"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T21:06:36.091Z","reference":"work:5208","note":"Hermann Hesse source person OL76437A and exact-ISBN KB authority p068404956 share Wikidata Q25973, ISNI0000000121296240 and VIAF41841418. This resolves Hermann/Hermann Karl without name-only matching. Exact DeSteppewolf paperback9789023411239; existing Work retained.","canonical_name_resolution":"Hermann Hesse source person OL76437A and exact-ISBN KB authority p068404956 share Wikidata Q25973, ISNI0000000121296240 and VIAF41841418. This resolves Hermann/Hermann Karl without name-only matching. Exact DeSteppewolf paperback9789023411239; existing Work retained."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-020.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL872773W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p078216117","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p085356573","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p371614406","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p830736387","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p841089167"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":6868165,"sha256":"7f45914a09af1bbb71c532861b731a363cae9c7384b66e12b2b4c504d6715705","reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-003.jpg. Hermann Hesse; De steppewolf. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"provenance":"origin